   1148  f22a							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1149  f22a							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1150  f22a							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1151  f22a							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1152  f22a							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
