   1226  f283							; --- Physics: vy += GRAVITY (gravity), vy -= JetPower (jet thrust). ---
   1227  f283							;     JetPower b7 = float flag (bugs #31): float frames add gravity
   1228  f283							;     only — subtracting $80+ would blast the player upward.
   1229  f283				   .Gravity
