   1503  f3e9							; UpdateEnemies — per-type live motion from RAM shadow (overscan).
   1504  f3e9							; E0: loop runs EVERY frame; each type carries its own speed gate (snake
   1505  f3e9							; ÷4 here; bat ungated, spider ÷8, tentacle ÷2/÷8, moth ÷2 in E1-E4).
   1506  f3e9							; Snake patrol: bounds are SYMMETRIC about the ROM spawn X (± SNAKE_PATROL =
   1507  f3e9							; one tile, user 2026-10-19 — see the constant): retreat a tile behind the
   1508  f3e9							; placement, come out a tile, repeat. The ROM dir still picks which way it
   1509  f3e9							; starts. Ignores editor range_* per user
   1510  f3e9							; 2026-09-23. First move = facing (live dir from LoadEnemyRam). No wall collision.
   1511  f3e9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
