   1751  f50e							; Connection table: 2 nibble-packed bytes per room (up<<4|down, left<<4|right),
   1752  f50e							; $F = no exit. After transition: player is placed at the OPPOSITE edge of the
   1753  f50e							; new room. Jetpack velocity carries over (matches comparison/hero pattern).
