   1942  f60c							; Accept iff RoomX - MinerX in [-6, +3].
   1943  f60c		       a5 80		      lda	RoomX
   1944  f60e		       38		      sec
   1945  f60f		       e5 a5		      sbc	MinerX
   1946  f611		       18		      clc
