   1950  f618							; Y overlap: player [RoomY, +11] vs miner [MinerY, +7]
   1951  f618							; accept iff RoomY - MinerY in [-11, +7]  (add 11, compare 19)
   1952  f618		       a5 81		      lda	RoomY
   1953  f61a		       38		      sec
   1954  f61b		       e5 a6		      sbc	MinerY
