   1967  f628							; ==============================================================================
   1968  f628							; SelectActiveObject — choose the single GRP1 object to draw this frame.
   1969  f628							; The TIA has one GRP1 sprite, so objects flicker by rotating slots each frame.
   1970  f628							; Sets ObjBase, ActiveObjectX, ActiveObjectY, ObjTop, COLUP1.
   1971  f628							; Slot count (enemies + miner?) lives in Temp for this VBLANK only.
   1972  f628							; Bomb fuse (state=1): low-priority — bomb only when (BombTimer&3)==0
   1973  f628							; (~15 Hz); other frames normal miner/enemy rotation (FlickerFrame alone).
   1974  f628							; One GRP1: cannot draw bomb + entity same frame.
   1975  f628							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1976  f628				   SelectActiveObject
   1977  f628							; Tally / frozen scene (DropTarget = $FE): show the PLAYER and the MINER
   1978  f628							; only — no enemies, no raft, no bomb. That frame bypasses the overscan, so
   1979  f628							; RefreshEnemyY never runs while bank1's HUD writes $E0-$EF: EnemyRamY
   1980  f628							; ($E2-$E4) is left holding score-pointer bytes, and any enemy drawn then
   1981  f628							; jumps to a garbage Y (user report 2026-10-18: the raft "moved up to the
   1982  f628							; middle of the screen" the moment the points counting started).
   1983  f628		       a5 8a		      lda	DropTarget
