   2644  f980							; --- Cell walk (cell_collision_plan 2.1): test the PF buffers directly ---
   2645  f980							; The ZP rect cache ($CC-$DF, 5-slot limit) is gone from THIS walker: the
   2646  f980							; render buffers PF0/1/2Buf ARE the map (BombMarkWalls punches bomb holes
   2647  f980							; into them), so room complexity is unbounded and geometry parity is proven
   2648  f980							; by tools/test_cell_map.py (box vs geometry, all models/rooms).
