   3086  fc8d							;   (byte-identical bank0/bank2, moth pattern — the $FBF8-$FC48 pad window
   3087  fc8d							;   is full: 5 B left, a stub needs 6 B). Call sites below keep
   3088  fc8d							;   `jmp HotOverlapFlag` (tail: 0 push) and the C=1 contract: body ends
   3089  fc8d							;   `sec / jmp $FBF8` (ReturnPad), so the pad's rts pops the ORIGINAL
   3090  fc8d							;   caller's return. Full behavior docs moved with the body.
   3091  fc8d							;   Behavior: if the player's proposed tile range (CollisionCell*) overlaps
   3092  fc8d							;   any hot-only rect, set Temp bit 7 (HotBump), called from PlayerHitsMap
