   3270  fd38							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3271  fd38							; TitleWork — level-select screen (DropTarget = $FF sentinel, dispatched from
   3272  fd38							; DropStep every frame). Player stands at the level start: no gravity, no
   3273  fd38							; enemies (count/miner cleared by DropArm .DATitle), no sound, timer frozen
   3274  fd38							; (tail skips the TickCounter/BarLevel block). HUD score = level+1.
   3275  fd38							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   3276  fd38							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   3277  fd38							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   3278  fd38							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   3279  fd38							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   3280  fd38							; (Intro $FD never reaches here — DropStep routes it to TitleIntro.)
   3281  fd38							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   3282  fd38							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   3283  fd38							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   3284  fd38							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3285  fd38				   TitleWork
   3286  fd38							; --- SELECT edge (TitleSelect, fill region) ---
