   3423  fdd1							; BombEnemyBlast — bank2 entry tramp ($FDD8, lamp-safe S9 2026-10-07): the
   3424  fdd1							; BombTick `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta $1FF8` switches to bank2, the `jmp`
   3425  fdd1							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   3426  fdd1							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   3427  fdd1							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
   3428  fdd1							; awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none. Old inline body ($F87F, 66B)
   3429  fdd1							; deleted: the region re-packs into the gap before the $FBD6 fold pin
   3430  fdd1							; (pre-pad headroom stays 1B — pins absorb upstream shrink, not the org).
